@startuml
autonumber
actor "User" as User
participant "UI (Avalonia)" as UI
participant "Image Cache" as ImgCache
participant "Local DB" as LocalDB
participant "API (Node.js)" as API
database "Central DB (MySQL)" as DB
participant "Image CDN" as CDN

User -> UI : Enter login & password
UI -> API : POST /auth/login
API -> DB : Verify credentials
API --> UI : Return JWT Token

== Two-Way State Synchronization ==
UI -> LocalDB : Get lastSyncTimestamp (T1) & Pending Local Changes
UI -> API : POST /api/sync\nPayload: { since: T1, localChanges: [...] }

API -> DB : 1. Apply user's local changes (Push)\n2. Fetch User Profile State (MyBar, Custom Drinks)\n3. Fetch Global Delta (since T1)
API --> UI : Return JSON (Global Updates + User Profile)
UI -> LocalDB : Upsert Cache & Update lastSyncTimestamp

UI -> UI : Initialize My Bar Calculation Engine
UI --> User : Display Main Dashboard (Cocktails list)

== Asynchronous Image Loading ==
User -> UI : Scrolls cocktail list
UI -> LocalDB : Read Cocktail data
LocalDB --> UI : Returns { name: "Mojito", imageUrl: "https://cdn.example.com/mojito.jpg" }
UI -> ImgCache : Request image (imageUrl)

alt Image not in local file cache
    ImgCache -> CDN : GET /mojito.jpg
    CDN --> ImgCache : Binary Image Data
    ImgCache -> ImgCache : Save to disk/memory
end

ImgCache --> UI : Display Image
@enduml